# 💱 Currency Converter – Old Money Style

This is a stylish and functional currency converter project built with **HTML**, **CSS**, and **JavaScript**, featuring a vintage-inspired "Old Money / Scrooge McDuck" design. The converter fetches real-time exchange rates and displays the local **time and date** above the interface.

