## 🧰 Features

- ✅ Real-time exchange rates via `open.er-api.com`
- ✅ Elegant and luxurious design in vintage style
- ✅ Live clock and date display (automatically adapts to user's system)
- ✅ Mobile-friendly and fully responsive layout
- ✅ Swap button to switch currencies quickly
- ✅ Smooth animations and hover effects

